1:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9496854543685913,"text_excerpt":"New brewery alert! I do believe I might have died and went to heaven because I love this place! Oak St Brewery is sooo cool! It's right by Blue Cypress Books so if you just CAN'T wait to get home before diving into your new book (like me), this is the perfect place to stop in for a pint. I tried the best sour I've had in a long time! Not too tart, but no funny flavors like rosemary or whatever. After I ordered my beer and was greeted by the world's best hostesses..... the owner's two meatball English bulldogs! Puppies and beer!!!! This place is pet friendly so you can bring your fur baby with you, too! You could also bring your human baby because they're also kid friendly. Let's be real, ..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
